<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.50-2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.50-2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-2.00 lower. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA US  1-3    230-260 lbs    58.00-59.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    57.00-59.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. 1.00-4.00 lower. US 1-3     All weights    44.50</p>
</text>
